sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Web UI
    participant A as App
    participant C as Claude
    participant DB as Corpus
    participant W as Web search
    UI->>A: GET stream for question
    Note over A,C: Local phase
    loop until finish_phase or budget reached
        A->>C: messages, local tools
        C-->>A: tool_use search or read_section
        A->>DB: search / read_section
        DB-->>A: hits or section text
        A-->>UI: SSE trace
    end
    C-->>A: finish_phase(sufficient, gaps)
    Note over A,C: Web phase, at least one web_search
    loop until finish_phase or budget reached
        A->>C: messages, web_search server tool
        C->>W: web_search (Claude's server tool)
        W-->>C: results with URLs
        opt pause_turn
            C-->>A: pause_turn
            Note over A: App re-sends the turn to resume
        end
        C-->>A: notes with sources
        A-->>UI: SSE trace
    end
    C-->>A: finish_phase(sufficient, gaps)
    A->>C: merge call, manual notes + web notes, no tools
    C-->>A: streamed answer text
    A-->>UI: SSE delta with [n] citations and ⚠ conflict blocks
    A-->>UI: SSE final
